---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import gate from '../../data/build-measured-value-gate.json';
const items = gate.required_measurement_evidence;
---
<Layout title="BUILD Measured Value Readiness | BitEvo" description="Evidence-safe BUILD gate between delivery and any measured-value or ROI claim. The synthetic value example is not customer evidence.">
  <section class="section"><div class="narrow"><div class="eyebrow">BUILD · MEASURED VALUE READINESS · PUBLIC TEMPLATE ONLY</div><h1 class="display">Delivery is not measured value.</h1><p class="lede">The USD 3,000 / five-business-day BUILD Workflow Exception Diagnostic can define a baseline and measurement method, but completed work alone cannot establish observed customer value. A bounded measured-value statement requires external evidence from the same workflow, denominator, observation window and buyer-approved sources.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section-tight section-rule"><div class="container panel" role="note"><strong>NO CUSTOMER RESULT · NO ROI CLAIM · NO MEASURED VALUE CLAIM · SYNTHETIC EXAMPLE IS NOT CUSTOMER EVIDENCE</strong><p>This public template represents no customer state. The existing workflow-value example is synthetic arithmetic only; it cannot prove delivery, observed value, savings, ROI, customer outcomes or renewal/expansion evidence.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section-rule"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Fixed BUILD offer</div><h2 class="section-title">One recurring exception workflow · USD 3,000 · five business days.</h2><article class="panel"><p>The commercial scope remains fixed. Measurement evidence must remain bound to the exact buyer-confirmed workflow and cannot be inferred from the public synthetic example.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="section section-rule"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Measurement evidence gate</div><h2 class="section-title">Eight external-evidence conditions are required before measured value can be stated.</h2>{items.map((item,index)=><article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')} · {item.status}</div><h3>{item.label}</h3></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="section section-rule"><div class="container"><article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">Current-state boundary</div><h2>No delivery or measurement state is represented.</h2><p><strong>delivery_started=false · delivery_completed=false · measurement_window_closed=false · measured_value_observed=false · customer_case_evidence=false</strong>.</p></article><article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">Synthetic boundary</div><h2>Synthetic arithmetic cannot substitute for measured value.</h2><p>The public workflow-value example demonstrates calculation structure only. Any measured-value, customer-result or ROI statement requires real external evidence and explicit buyer acceptance.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="section section-rule"><div class="container hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/build/paid-start-gate">Back to paid-start gate</a><a class="button button-ghost" href="/build/workflow-value-example">Inspect synthetic value example</a><a class="button button-ghost" href="/build/measured-value-gate.json">Open machine-readable gate</a></div></section>
</Layout>
